	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_1": "The Reactor is a multi-block of Reactor Casings",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_2": "Rod Assemblies on top hold the rods that control the reaction",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_3": "Fuel Rods generate power proportional to their count and adjacency",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_4": "Control Rods absorb power and is used to stop the reaction",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_5": "If power exceeds hull capacity the reactor takes damage — keep them balanced!",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_6": "The reactor consumes water — pump it into the casing to keep it cooled",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_7": "Steam Turbines bolted to the reactor face convert heat into Rotational Force",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_8": "A Reactor Redstone Interface arms the reactor when it receives a redstone signal",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_9": "Without a signal the reactor SCRAMs — control rods drop and the reaction stops",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_10": "Fuel Rods gradually deplete and must be swapped out to keep the reactor running",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_11": "A Mechanical Arm picks up Depleted Fuel Rods and deposits them into a funnel",
	"createatomic.ponder.reactor.text_12": "A second arm takes fresh rods from a Depot and loads empty Rod Assemblies"
